    "subTitle": "Barbarian FAQ",
    "description": "A Barbarian is a durable martial class built around Rage, a limited combat state that improves Strength-based offense and makes the character much harder to bring down. Barbarians use a d12 Hit Die, are proficient with simple and martial weapons, and usually fight on the front line with high Strength and Constitution.",
