    "title": "D&D Portal - What is a Bard in D&D?",
    "subTitle": "Bard FAQ",
    "description": "A Bard is a Charisma-based full spellcaster and skill-focused support class that combines magic, Bardic Inspiration, broad proficiencies, Expertise, and social ability. Bards use a d8 Hit Die, can fill many different party roles, and choose a Bard College at 3rd level to specialise in areas such as knowledge, martial combat, enchantment, performance, or other forms of magical artistry.",
