    "title": "D&D Portal - What is the Path of the Ancestral Guardian?",
    "subTitle": "Path of the Ancestral Guardian FAQ",
    "description": "The Path of the Ancestral Guardian is a defensive Barbarian path that summons ancestral spirits to hinder enemies, protect allies and punish attacks made against anyone other than the Barbarian. Choosing Ancestral Guardian at Barbarian 3 adds its defender identity to the normal Rage, Reckless Attack, Extra Attack, Fast Movement, Brutal Critical, Relentless Rage, and other core Barbarian progression.",
